~ chuck_rencontre
do get_viewport().set_input_as_handled()
if first_met == true:
	if GameState.has_ability("sword"):
		Chuck: Go kill this motherfucker now.
	else:
		Chuck: The sword is up there. C'mon buddy...
elif not first_met and GameState.has_ability("sword"):
	Chuck: Hey, did you take my sword without my permission ?!
	Todd: Yep and what are you gonna do about it ?
	Chuck: ... You piece of shit...
else:
	Chuck: Todd ! You're awake, did you feel that ?
	- Yep !
		Todd: Yep ! What's going on ? Are we gonna die ?
		Chuck: Hell nah. It's just the Archmage...
	- No
		Chuck: Don't lie to me little brat. The Archmage is blowing everything up !
		do GameEvents.emit_camera_shake(1.0)
		do GameEvents.emit_camera_shake(1.0)
		do GameEvents.emit_camera_shake(1.0)
		# Play explosion sound
	Chuck: This motherfucker's goin crazy ! You need to beat his ass up to make him realise who's boss here !
	- Okay !
		Chuck: Good boy ! Take the sword up there and KILL THEM ALL !
	- Do it yourself
		Todd: Hummm... I dunno, why don't you do it yourself ?
		Chuck: Don't be a brat, take the sword up there and KILL THEM ALL !
		Todd: ...
	Chuck: Another thing. If you see me later, come talk to me, I'll sell you things.

do first_met = true
=> END